{
    "title": "Wedding Planner by WeddingWire",
    "description": "We do weddings. Ready to plan yours? Wedding Planner by WeddingWire is the only (free!) wedding app you\u2019ll ever need. Start planning today with:\r\n\r\nLocal Vendors: Search over 250,000 local wedding professionals, get pricing and availability details and read 3+ million reviews from couples like you. \r\n\r\n360\u00ba Virtual Wedding Venue Tours: Save time and make more informed decisions by taking an interactive tour of wedding venues before you visit.\r\n\r\nFree Wedding Websites: Customize your wedding website in a snap, share wedding details, add your registry and collect RSVPs.\r\n\r\nWedding Invitations: Shop beautiful and affordable invitations with matching wedding websites. Personalize your paper in minutes with our easy wedding invitation maker.  \r\n\r\nWedding Checklist: We\u2019ll create a list of wedding tasks for you based on your wedding date. Your to-do list is completely customizable and accessible from anywhere.\r\n\r\nWedding Budget: Keep track of how much you\u2019re spending on your venue, wedding dress, flowers, caterer, cake and more! \r\n\r\nWedding Guest List: Easily organize your guest list. Track meal selections and RSVPs for all of your wedding guests.\r\n\r\nWedding Registry: Add all of your wedding registries to one simple list and share it on your wedding website. \r\n\r\nWedding Inspiration: Get inspired by photo galleries of real weddings, wedding dresses, flowers, cakes, invitations, favors, jewelry and so much more.\r\n\r\nCommunity: Gather ideas and advice from other engaged couples who are also going through the wedding planning process.\r\n\r\nWedding Countdown: Track the time left until your wedding day\u2014just pop in your wedding date and begin counting down!\r\n\r\nDownload Wedding Planner by WeddingWire and start planning the easy way.\r\n\r\nCA Privacy:\r\nhttps://www.weddingwire.com/ca-collection-notice/",
